trolled handling of defects, technical debt, releases and product lifecycle updates. Product Approval & Regulatory Compliance Coordinate approvals with certification bodies and accredited laboratories for applicable frameworks such as UL, CSA, IEC, CE, UKCA, VDE, ATEX and IECEx. Ensure availability and integrity of technical files, declarations, test evidence, certificates, approval drawings and compliance records. Assess the compliance impact of new designs, component changes, product modifications, transfers and obsolescence. Program, Budget & Stakeholder Management Plan engineering resources, project schedules, laboratory investments, external testing costs and operating budgets. Provide transparent reporting on delivery, quality, risks, capacity, cost and certification status to management. Work closely with global R&D, product management, quality, manufacturing, sourcing, service and external partners. Escalate critical technical or compliance risks with clear options, impact assessment and recommended actions. \n Decision-Making Authority Recommend and allocate engineering resources within approved plans and priorities. Approve technical reviews, verification readiness and engineering deliverables within the defined governance framework. Stop or escalate development, testing or release activities when product safety, quality or compliance is at risk. Select appropriate development methods, test strategies and external laboratory support within deleg","role_search":"Software Engineer"},{"title":"Junior Search Engine Optimization (SEO) Executive","company":"Digitally Bugged LLP","location":"Mumbai","source":"internshala","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-junior-search-engine-optimization-seo-executive-job-in-mumbai-at-digitally-bugged-llp1793856285","date_posted":"2026-11-18","experience":"","is_walkin":false,"role_search":"Content Writer"},{"title":"Data Strategist","company":"Accenture","location":"Bangalore","source":"timesjobs","url":"https:/